Falsifies `subtree_scope::proofs::a_step_is_one_name`.

The defect: `is_name` forgets `..`. A path could then go up out of the grant.

Expected to fail: the assertion inside the lookup that no step is `..`.

diff --git a/crates/subtree_scope/src/lib.rs b/crates/subtree_scope/src/lib.rs
--- a/crates/subtree_scope/src/lib.rs
+++ b/crates/subtree_scope/src/lib.rs
@@ -94,7 +94,6 @@
 pub fn is_name(component: &[u8]) -> bool {
     !component.is_empty()
         && component != b"."
-        && component != b".."
         && !component.contains(&b'/')
         && !component.contains(&0)
 }
